+	// Ultra XR: the runtime's classes are loaded with the application's class loader's PARENT (the boot class
+	// loader) as their parent, not the application's own. With the application's loader as parent, kotlin.* and
+	// androidx.* resolved to the application's copies first, and an application built with a code shrinker has
